cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software record and the paper below."
type: software
title: "Agentic AI orchestration pipeline for rapid analysis of chokepoint crises (Strait of Hormuz 2026 case)"
abstract: >-
  LangGraph-based orchestration of a multi-model, multi-scenario analytical pipeline that
  bridges short-run and long-run, micro and macro, and economic and strategic assessment of
  chokepoint crises. Includes domain-model adapters (Python, Julia, GAMS, R, AnyLogic, Octave,
  EViews, Fortran, Excel), analyst checkpoints, upstream-to-downstream forwarding, cross-model
  consistency checks, a synthesis fidelity audit, a coverage ledger, and a deterministic
  analyst baseline for comparison with the LLM-driven path.
